{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53579","headline":"咏廿四气诗 清明三月节 · 元稹","name":"咏廿四气诗 清明三月节","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清明来向晚，山渌正光华。\n杨柳先飞絮，梧桐续放花。\n鴽声知化鼠，虹影指天涯。\n已识风云意，宁愁雨谷（一作「谷雨」）赊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53579.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53579","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}